{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"平\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大块能独立交代人物处境、原因和心理转折，X的高亮词组虽然短，但单看“猛然想到”“舍不得什么”等片段，有时不容易还原主要意思；small：Y的感受与按音乐节点出现的旁注大多能互相补充，既有身体体验，也有具体听觉线索，不读旁注也不影响主线。core：两版都贯穿了不愿再受委屈与怀念旧日亲近、归属感之间的拉扯，结尾也都落在带着想念继续生活，判平；fine：X有“我到底在气谁又在想谁”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”等更有辨识度的体验，Y的身体感受更直接，但部分表达较常见，整体差不多。concise：X相对收敛，Y有些地方重复铺陈，例如S06反复说身边有人带来的轻松，S13多次表达期待重新遇到亲近的人；human：X更符合日常说话习惯，Y的“熟悉的旧日生活”“缺少归属的空缺”“心脏以最高负荷剧烈跳动”等有冗余或搭配生硬的问题；load：Y每屏通常只有2至5个完整大块，且与停留时间相称，X则常有4至8处高亮短语，部分切分后显得悬空，扫读时不够连贯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6266eea8-c544-4841-88c0-a8723e85224a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T201845709629Z", "elapsed_seconds": 367.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:24:53.194216+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7848fcac6a695627560091013a919c2f1a28cf42b5729af852bd94bbcd2f2711", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatg